Read AGENTS.md fully. Use docs/chat-commands.md for /setup, /daily-run, /tailor-cv, /weekly-report and /linkedin-growth and fallback chat prompts. Route setup/CV drops to skills/00-onboarding-chat.md, daily runs to skills/00-daily-run.md, tailoring to skills/tailor-resume.md, reports to skills/weekly-insights.md, and growth to LinkedIn profile/post skills. Exact-text approval is required before Save/Post.

Native slash commands are version-dependent; .agent/workflows contains portable instructions, not universal registration. MCP config comes from mcp/mcp.template.json; see mcp/README.md. Actual tools/permissions and persistent local profile required; Notion opt-in, local JSON primary. Run helpers for the owner when authorized. Daily order: owned lock, preflight, auth, context; never skip safety. Markdown skills are the product; leave src/ untouched.
